#: src/setup.cpp:52
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Allgemene Instellen"

#: src/setup.cpp:56
msgid "Timings"
msgstr ""

#: src/setup.cpp:60
msgid "During Breaks"
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:58
msgid "&Automatically start RSIBreak at startup"
msgstr "RSIBreak bi't Hoochfahren &Automaatsch starten"

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:59
msgid ""
"With this option you can indicate that you want RSIBreak to start when KDE "
"starts."
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:62
msgid "Break Timer Settings"
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:63
msgid "Break at &fixed times and ignore movement during breaks"
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:65
msgid ""
"With this option you indicate that you want to ignore movements during "
"breaks and want to break at fixed intervals"
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:68
msgid "Take into account the &idle settings"
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:70
msgid ""
"With this option you indicate that you want to use idle detection. This "
"means that only the time you are active (when you use the keyboard or the "
"mouse) will be counted when evaluating the position of the next break."
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:84
msgid "Idle Settings"
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:87
msgid "&Reset timers after period of idleness"
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:88
msgid ""
"With this checkbox you indicate that you want the timers for the next break "
"to be reset if you are sufficiently idle (you are idle more that the "
"duration of the corresponding break)"
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:92
msgid "&Show when timers are reset"
msgstr "&Wiesen wenn de Tietgever trüchsett warrt"

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:94
msgid ""
"With this checkbox you indicate that you want to see when the timers are "
"reset. This happens when you have been idle for a while."
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:98
msgid "&Ignore idle detection for tiny breaks"
msgstr ""

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:101
msgid ""
"With this option you select that the <b>short</b> breaks shouldn't be reset "
"when idle. This is useful, for example, when you are reading something and "
"you don't touch the mouse or keyboard for the duration of a short break, but "
"you still want to have a short break every once in a while."
msgstr ""

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:71
msgid "Skipping Breaks"
msgstr "Posen övergahn"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:73
msgid "H&ide button"
msgstr "Knoop &Versteken"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:74
msgid ""
"Check this option to disable and hide the skip button. This way you can "
"prevent skipping the break."
msgstr ""

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:77
msgid "&Shortcut Locks"
msgstr ""

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Check this option to disable the skip shortcut. This way you can prevent "
"skipping the break. Instead it will lock the screen."
msgstr "Krüüz disse Optschoon an, wenn Du verhinnern wullt, dat de Poos afkörtt warrt. De Scherm warrt eenfach afslaten."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:91 src/setuptiming.cpp:124
msgid "Slideshow"
msgstr "Diaschau"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:97
msgid ""
"Select the folder from which you want to see images. These images are "
"randomly shown during the breaks. It will be searched recursively if you "
"want..."
msgstr "Söök den Orner ut, ut den Du Biller sehn wullt. Disse Biller warrt in de Poos tofällig wiest. Wenn Du wullt, kann de Orner ok rekursiev dörsöcht warrn..."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:100
msgid "&Change..."
msgstr "Ä&nnern..."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:102
msgid "Search path recursively"
msgstr "Den Padd rekursiev dörsöken"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:118
msgid "Popup"
msgstr "Opduukfinster"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:120
msgid ""
"RSIBreak can show a popup near the systray instead of replacing your whole "
"screen with a picture."
msgstr ""

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:124
msgid "&Use the popup"
msgstr "Opduukfinster Br&uken"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:126
msgid ""
"With this checkbox you can indicate if you want to see the popup when it is "
"time to break. It will count down to zero, so you know how long this break "
"will be."
msgstr "Mit dit Krüüzfeld kannst Du fastleggen, dat Du en Opduukfinster sehn wullt, wenn dat Tiet is, foffteihn to maken. Dat tellt denn rünner bet Null, so dat Du weetst, wo lang de Poos is."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:131
msgid "The popup can flash when it detects that you are still active."
msgstr "Dat Opduukfinster kann wiest warrn, wenn dat faststellt, dat Du jümmers noch aktiv büst."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:135
msgid "&Flash on activity"
msgstr "&Opduukfinster bi Aktivität"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:136
msgid ""
"With this checkbox you can indicate if you want to see the popup flash when "
"there is activity."
msgstr "Mit dit Krüüzfeld kannst Du fastleggen, dat Du en Opduukfinster sehn wullt, wenn dor Aktivität is"

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:58
msgid "Tiny Breaks"
msgstr "Lierlütte Posen"

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:61
msgid "Short break every:"
msgstr "Korte Poos jümmers na:"

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:63
msgid ""
"Here you can set how often you want a short break. One minute means 60 "
"seconds of movement with the mouse or typing on the keyboard."
msgstr ""

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:73 src/setuptiming.cpp:106
msgid "For a duration of:"
msgstr "För de Düer vun:"

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:75
msgid "Here you can set the duration of the short break."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du instellen, wo lang en korte Poos düern schall."

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:91
msgid "Big Breaks"
msgstr "Grote Posen"

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:94
msgid "Long break every:"
msgstr "Lange Poos jümmers na:"

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:96
msgid ""
"Here you can set how often you want a long break. One minute means 60 "
"seconds of movement with the mouse or typing on the keyboard"
msgstr ""

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:108
msgid "Here you can set the duration of the long break."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du instellen, wo lang en lange Poos düern schall."

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:127
msgid "Change images every:"
msgstr "Biller ännern jümmers na:"

#: src/setuptiming.cpp:129
msgid ""
"Here you can set how long one image should be shown before it is replaced by "
"the next one."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du instellen, wo lang en Bild wiest warrt bet dat dör en anner Bild utwesselt warrt."

